 view camera; Arlo Go 2, a camera for monitoring remote areas, large properties, construction sites, vacation homes, boat or RV slips, and hard-to-access areas; and Arlo Floodlight Camera, a wire-free floodlight camera. It also provides security system accessories, charging accessories, and mounts. In addition, the company offers Arlo Secure subscriptions, including AI-powered recognition and detection; 2K secure plan and 4K secure plus plan cloud-based video recording; unlimited cameras; advanced object detection; smart interactive notifications; smoke and CO alarm detection; cloud-based activity zone; call a friend; and 24/7 priority support and professional monitoring services; Arlo Total Security, a subscription which provides 24/7 professional monitoring and security hardware; Arlo Safe, a personal safety app that offers one-touch emergency response, family safety, and crash detection and response services; and Arlo SmartCloud, a SaaS solution that delivers security cloud services for business. It sells its products through retailers, wholesale distributors, broadcast channels, wireless carriers, and security solution providers, as well as through its website. Arlo Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 2018 and is headquartered in Carlsbad, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Matthew Blake McRae | CEO & Director | Age 51 | Compensation: $1.8M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 376 people. Revenue per employee of $1.4M ranks in the top quartile among Industrials peers, improving at 6%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Stock-based compensation of $166K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Arlo Technologies, Inc. is a small-cap industrials business with a $1.3B market cap on $529M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +3% over the past three years, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at -106% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 28%.","Accruals are elevated at -20.5% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield of 3.4% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and stock-based comp at 12% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 3.1% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.1\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.4% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Industrials peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 345% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":3.4450832072617246},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $5.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 8% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Industrials ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Industrials tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Among the least levered in Industrials \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Stock Analysts\u2019 Ratings Reiterations for November 6th (ABNB, ACLS, AFRM, ALB, ARLO, ATO, AUTO, AXON, BETA, BTA)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/stock-analysts-ratings-reiterations-for-november-6th-abnb-acls-afrm-alb-arlo-ato-auto-axon-beta-bta.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793990688.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Arlo Technologies (NYSE:ARLO) Posts Earnings Results, Beats Estimates By $0.04 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/arlo-technologies-nysearlo-posts-earnings-results-beats-estimates-by-0-04-eps.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793986018.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.077,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Arlo Technologies (NYSE:ARLO) Stock Falls 11.4% After Insider Selling","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/arlo-technologies-nysearlo-stock-falls-11-4-after-insider-selling.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793979670.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.778,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Arlo\u2019s Third Quarter: A Good Story, Priced on 1 Launch","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/arlo-third-quarter-good-story-131301060.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":17939707